Name: obscura
Short Name: obscura
URL: https://github.com/aphrody-labs/obscura
Version: 0.1.0
Revision: 0d9a2f764ffdb097269da048002c593865e83a9e
Update Mechanism: Manual (tools/import.py obscura, history replayed linearly)
License: Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Rust API for the Obscura headless browser

Local Modifications:
The crates (10) live in third_party/obscura/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by
tools/flatten.py (path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate) and patched by
tools/fixups.sh and tools/patches/. Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/obscura/ unchanged.

Crates:
  obscura 0.1.0 third_party/obscura/obscura (not in the workspace)
  obscura-browser 0.1.0 third_party/obscura/obscura-browser (not in the workspace)
  obscura-cdp 0.1.0 third_party/obscura/obscura-cdp (not in the workspace)
  obscura-cli 0.1.0 third_party/obscura/obscura-cli (not in the workspace)
  obscura-dom 0.1.0 third_party/obscura/obscura-dom
  obscura-js 0.1.0 third_party/obscura/obscura-js (not in the workspace)
  obscura-mcp 0.1.0 third_party/obscura/obscura-mcp (not in the workspace)
  obscura-net 0.1.0 third_party/obscura/obscura-net
  obscura-render 0.1.0 third_party/obscura/obscura-render
  obscura-ssrf 0.1.0 third_party/obscura/obscura-ssrf
